    <string name="condition_pricing_menu">Value by condition…</string>
    <string name="condition_pricing">Value by condition</string>
    <string name="condition_pricing_explain">Cardmarket and Scryfall give a single price per card, without telling conditions apart: it is the price of cards in good condition (NM). With this option, each card is worth its price multiplied by the percentage of its condition. For example, a €10 card in EX (85%) counts as €8.50.</string>
    <string name="condition_pricing_switch">Adjust value by condition</string>
    <string name="condition_pricing_note">The percentages are an estimate, in line with what is usually paid for used cards; adjust them to your market. They apply to the collection total, each row and exports. Card prices (and their changes) are always market prices.</string>
