    <string name="test_photos">Test photos</string>
    <string name="test_photos_menu">Test photos…</string>
    <string name="test_photos_explain">To measure how well the app recognises cards with your phone. While it is on, every scanned card also saves the camera photo it was recognised from. Afterwards, fix any wrong cards in the collection (edition, language, or delete them): what is left in the collection is taken as the right answer for each photo.</string>
